   "like_count": 3,
   "cooked": "<p>Wanted to start a thread to share playlists - could use some new tunes and work goes by better with tunes!</p>\n<p>Here are two lists I made on Spotify, still under construction but gets me through A LOT!</p>\n<p><img alt=\":nerd_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/nerd_face.png?v=9\" title=\":nerd_face:\"/><img alt=\":milky_way:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/milky_way.png?v=9\" title=\":milky_way:\"/>Intergalactic Librarians<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/997484f3e6313397dc737531b2f233352912832f.png\" width=\"196\"/>\n<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/69Z6C9NGmjtcbRaIp3jLqy?si=clIugJbEQmeDhvQ2tARSrQ\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d178ac5be3b9a3a1f72b1e27db7cbd433f8efb64_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/d178ac5be3b9a3a1f72b1e27db7cbd433f8efb64.jpeg\" width=\"500\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/69Z6C9NGmjtcbRaIp3jLqy?si=clIugJbEQmeDhvQ2tARSrQ\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Intergalactic Librarians, a playlist by Jessica Zartler on Spotify</a></h3>\n<p>A playlist featuring Kidswaste, In Love With a Ghost, Sense, and others</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p><img alt=\":recycle:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/recycle.png?v=9\" title=\":recycle:\"/> Robinhoods of the Regenaissance<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/997484f3e6313397dc737531b2f233352912832f.png\" width=\"196\"/>\n<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1pj6XsGS9xzxbCN2n52YLz?si=g7v6KdEoQ92_IOZ2M-lmiQ\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/26212eb0541e0164fb585ad0bc89920c7541352b_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/26212eb0541e0164fb585ad0bc89920c7541352b.jpeg\" width=\"500\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1pj6XsGS9xzxbCN2n52YLz?si=g7v6KdEoQ92_IOZ2M-lmiQ\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Robinhoods of the Regenaissance, a playlist by Jessica Zartler on Spotify</a></h3>\n<p>A playlist featuring Anderson .Paak, Oxmo Puccino, Cardi B, and others</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>Would love to hear your fav playlist and tunes… Have a beautiful week!<img alt=\":revolving_hearts:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/revolving_hearts.png?v=9\" title=\":revolving_hearts:\"/></p>",
