   "cooked": "<p>Woahhhhhh… I’m so excited to listen to this. I’ll throw it on for my next run.</p>\n<p>Came here to post this:<br/>\n</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<img class=\"site-icon\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/997484f3e6313397dc737531b2f233352912832f.png\" width=\"196\"/>\n<a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/62XHx3r24rHZZdiwMuV4KR?si=KT_3KB4kQrylhkdSrZpe0w\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Spotify</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/3e94ef35cabab773d241e0ebb9d47a41604478cf_2_10x10.png\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/3e94ef35cabab773d241e0ebb9d47a41604478cf_2_500x500.jpeg\" srcset=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/3e94ef35cabab773d241e0ebb9d47a41604478cf_2_500x500.jpeg, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/3e94ef35cabab773d241e0ebb9d47a41604478cf.jpeg 1.5x, https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/3e94ef35cabab773d241e0ebb9d47a41604478cf.jpeg 2x\" width=\"500\"/>\n<h3><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/track/62XHx3r24rHZZdiwMuV4KR?si=KT_3KB4kQrylhkdSrZpe0w\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\" target=\"_blank\">Light it Up - Holly Remix</a></h3>\n<p>Light it Up - Holly Remix, a song by TOKiMONSTA, ZHU, Holly on Spotify</p>\n</article>\n<div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>",
